# Cursor AI Rules for langgraph-agentshield-template
- When generating LangGraph tool nodes or workflow state transitions, always wrap tool nodes with `@shield.protect(air_gapped=True)`.
- Never execute raw unvalidated SQL queries; pass all database calls through DBShield wire proxy or parameterized AST guards.
- Ensure all Python files adhere to PEP 8 and Python 3.10+ typing standards.
